    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; margin-top: 1em; vertical-align: top; width: 660px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"margin: 0; background-color: transparent; font-size: 120%; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color:#FFF; padding:0.2em 0.4em;\">欢迎！\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2f/Qb-wiki-logo-1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110824002242\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Qb-wiki-logo-1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Qb-wiki-logo-1.png\" data-image-key=\"Qb-wiki-logo-1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2f/Qb-wiki-logo-1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110824002242\" /></a></span><br /><div style=\"font-size:170%\"><b>欢迎来到女皇之刃维基！</b></div>\n<p><br />\n\n关于Hobby Japan的女皇之刃系列的维基，  <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Editing\" title=\"Help:Editing\">任何人都可以编辑</a>.\n</p><p>本维基拥有大约  <b>419</b>  篇文章。\n\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"border: 1px solid #6e0000; margin-top: 0em; vertical-align: top; width: 600px;\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"margin: 0; background-color: #6e0000; font-size: 120%; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; color:#FFF; padding:0.2em 0.4em;\">系列导航\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a366802918e38439edde6a4683eb2603\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-galle